<PageTitle>FSM Layer: Micro-Behaviors</PageTitle>

<h1>FSM Layer: Micro-Behaviors</h1>

<p>
    The FSM Layer consists of hundreds to thousands of pre-built FSM behaviors, packaged as
    micro-packages for the Unity Asset Store. These behaviors provide developers with near drag-and-drop
    functionality for complex tasks like AI, UI flows, and character animation logic, significantly
    accelerating development.
</p>

<h2>Product Categories</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Character AI (e.g., Patrol, Chase, Attack)</li>
    <li>UI/UX Flows (e.g., Loading, Main Menu, Options)</li>
    <li>World Interaction (e.g., Door Lock/Unlock, Item Pickup)</li>
</ul>